WEBVTT

00:12:59.858 --> 00:13:03.529
We just need political will
and money to be available.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.866
MR: So you would even say, you know,

00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:14.206
that you wouldn't even have gas
as a temporary, just transition solution

00:13:14.248 --> 00:13:16.542
to help women, for example, in particular,

00:13:16.542 --> 00:13:19.920
to get more choices
of access to clean cooking?

00:13:19.962 --> 00:13:21.380
VN: We cannot bring gas.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:24.716
I believe there are more sustainable
ways to help women.

00:13:24.716 --> 00:13:26.134
MR: So you you are very firm.

00:13:26.134 --> 00:13:27.302
VN: Yes.

00:13:27.344 --> 00:13:28.929
MR: I'd love you to talk more

00:13:28.971 --> 00:13:32.432
about the Africa that could be there